Yeh issue do ya teen main jagahon par cache ya database sync na hone ki wajah se aata hai.

Is problem ki main reasons aur unke direct solutions yeh hain:

1. Firebase Realtime Database / Firestore me Old Records mojood hain

Issue: Jab aapne GitHub se stickers delete kiye, toh Firebase database me un stickers ki URLs ya data delete nahi hua. App GitHub se direct list nahi banati balke Firebase se read karti hai, aur GitHub par image na milne ki wajah se wo image app me broken/cached dikhti hai.

Solution: Firebase Console me ja kar Firestore ya Realtime Database kholen aur jo stickers GitHub se delete kiye hain, unki entries/documents manual ya script ke zariye Firebase se bhi delete karen.

2. App / Glide / Coil Image Caching

Issue: App ke andar image loading libraries (jaise Glide, Picasso, ya Coil) ya local SQLite/Room database purane stickers ko device ke cache me save rakhti hai.

Solution:

App ki setting me ja kar Clear Storage / Clear Cache kar ke test karen.

Agar local database (Room/SQLite) use kar rahe hain, toh database ko update/clear karne ka logic likhen.

Image load karte waqt memory cache skip karne ki bajaye Firebase se fetched list ko update rakhen.

3. GitHub Raw CDN Cache (Agar URL same rakhi ho)

Issue: raw.githubusercontent.com URLs par strong caching hoti hai (aksar 5 se 10 minute tak). Agar aapne same file name se replace kiya hai toh purani file hi serve hoti rehti hai.

Solution: Sticker URLs me query parameter lagayen (e.g., ?v=2) ya naye sticker ka file name hamesha unique rakhen (jaise sticker_01_v2.png).

Best Fix Workflow:

Firebase Database open karen aur purane deleted stickers ke records remove karen.

App ka data/cache clear kar ke dubara open karen.

Aapki screenshot se clear ho raha hai ke Realtime Database me sirf pack_stats (download count/statistics) save hain, sticker files ki list database me nahi balke aapki GitHub repository ya App Code ke andar hardcoded JSON/links se chal rahi hai.

Is problem ko fix karne ke 3 steps:

1. GitHub Raw JSON File Check Karen

Agar aapne GitHub par koi stickers.json ya packs.json file rakhi hui hai jahan se app sticker ki list fetch karti hai, toh us JSON file ko open kar ke dekhein.

Wahan se purane stickers ke image URLs aur identifiers ko manually delete kar ke commit karen.

2. GitHub CDN Cache Bypassing

raw.githubusercontent.com par cache 5 se 10 minute tak rehta hai.

Agar app mein direct raw link di hui hai (e.g. [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/.../stickers.json](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/.../stickers.json)), to uske aage version query laga dein ya cache invalidate hone ka thoda intezar karein.

3. App Storage & Local Cache Reset

Phone ki Settings > Apps > AV6 Stickers > Storage me ja kar Clear Data / Clear Storage karen.

App dubara open karenge toh wo GitHub se fresh list load karegi aur purane cached stickers gayab ho jayenge.

(Note: Realtime Database me jo pack_stats -> pack01 hai, wo sirf download count track kar raha hai, usko delete karne ki zaroorat nahi hai jab tak aap poora pack hi na khatam karna chahein).

