Aapke liye sabse aasan solution aik chota sa script hai jo aapke pure folder structure ko scan kar ke automatically 100% exact contents.json bana dega bina kisi typing error ke.

Method 1: Python Script (Recommended & Fastest)
Agar aapke computer me Python installed hai:

Apne main sticker folder me jahan sare folders (pack01, pack02... pack60) hain, wahan aik file banayein generate_json.py.

Yeh code usme paste karein:

Python
import json
import os

base_dir = "."  # Current directory jahan pack folders hain
sticker_packs = []

# Saare pack folders ko filter aur sort karna
folders = [
    f
    for f in os.listdir(base_dir)
    if os.path.isdir(os.path.join(base_dir, f)) and f.lower().startswith("pack")
]
folders.sort()

for folder in folders:
    folder_path = os.path.join(base_dir, folder)
    all_files = os.listdir(folder_path)

    # Webp aur png images find karna (tray ke ilawa)
    stickers_list = []
    tray_file = f"{folder}/tray.webp"

    for file in all_files:
        if file.lower() == "tray.webp" or file.lower() == "tray.png":
            tray_file = f"{folder}/{file}"
        elif file.lower().endswith((".webp", ".png")):
            stickers_list.append({"image_file": f"{folder}/{file}"})

    # Pack ka structure
    pack_data = {
        "identifier": folder,
        "name": f"AV6 {folder.upper()}",
        "publisher": "insta ayan6v",
        "tray_image_file": tray_file,
        "publisher_email": "",
        "publisher_website": "",
        "privacy_policy_website": "",
        "license_agreement_website": "",
        "stickers": stickers_list,
    }
    sticker_packs.append(pack_data)

final_json = {
    "android_play_store_link": "",
    "ios_app_store_link": "",
    "sticker_packs": sticker_packs,
}

with open("contents.json", "w", encoding="utf-8") as f:
    json.dump(final_json, f, indent=2)

print("contents.json successfully generate ho gayi hai!")
Terminal/CMD me python generate_json.py run karein. Yeh har folder ke random names (1, 2, 34, 54 etc.) ko khud scan kar ke valid contents.json generate kar dega.

